<title>USA: Cooper unit gets FDA OK on KOH system.</title>
<headline>Cooper unit gets FDA OK on KOH system.</headline>
<dateline>SHELTON, CONN. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Cos said Wednesday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration approved the company's KOH Colpotomizer System for laproscopic hysterectomy surgery.</p>
<p>Cooper said it expects to begin marketing the system, made by the company's CooperSurgical unit, immediately in the U.S. and internationally.</p>
<p>The company did not say how much the system will contribute to earnings or how soon.</p>
<p>Cooper officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
